    "body": "indeed! that was a bit of a silly miss, thanks for the catch. fixed as suggested! (though I went with top level traversable instead as it seems more clear to me / done elsewhere)\r\n\r\nFWIW, I went down a bit of a rabbit hole here, and experimented with whether it makes sense for every browsing context to hold a group (set at creation, never changing) which would fix that bug structurally. I think it _might_ make sense to do (it did seem to work out to be a bit less spec text overall), but I decided in the end against pushing it as I wasn't convinced it was meaningfully better as it opens up some other complexities. Happy to push if you feel worthwhile.",
